      "id": "s07",
      "type": "UV_STAGE",
      "narration": "So what is a virtual environment, really? Honestly, it's a folder. Inside sits a Python interpreter, plus the packages this one project asked for. Nothing lands system-wide, which means two projects can want two different versions of the same library and neither one breaks the other.",
