    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "type": "RECORDED_STEP",
      "narration": "Interpreters are uv's business too. Ask it what it can see — uv python list. Some of these are already installed. The ones marked download available get fetched on demand, with no system package manager anywhere in the picture. And when you're ready to ship, run uv build. Two files came out — a source distribution, and a wheel. Those are exactly what PyPI wants. Empty folder to publishable package, on one binary.",
